{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/HellInSpace.png?t=1747863577\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FaceSeperator.png?t=1747863577\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OnSlaught\u00a0puts you in the pilot seat of an unending nightmare - where an entire alien civilization wants you <strong>dead</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll face diverse enemies, each demanding a unique weapon and strategy to defeat, similar to classic boomer shooters like DOOM.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight flesh abominations, Slingshot around black holes, and destroy a hellish army of biomechanical alien ships while flying into the darkness of space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FaceSeperator.png?t=1747863577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/EyeGifCropped.gif?t=1747863577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/Destructable_Maps.png?t=1747863577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/GrappleGifCropped.gif?t=1747863577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FaceSeperator.png?t=1747863577\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost every asteroid in OnSlaught is fully destructable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use environmental debris you create to fling explosive barrels, asteroids, and space junk at you enemies alongside your massive arsenal of weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FaceSeperator.png?t=1747863577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/OneManVsGod.png?t=1747863577\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FallGif2Cropped.gif?t=1747863577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FaceSeperator.png?t=1747863577\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your humanity has been stripped away. Only agony remains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">God will bleed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FaceSeperator.png?t=1747863577\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1698820?t=1747863577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1698820?t=1747863577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/eab46040fbe6de71a29f22d6f2c40e8572071e83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747863577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/eab46040fbe6de71a29f22d6f2c40e8572071e83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747863577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depictions of human biomechanical abominations. Occasional corpses, entrails, and